296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (One more layer we can add to our Matrix is the inclusion the C minor chord family \(the parallel minor scale to C major - always the natural minor scale\). This operates like a darker upside down world \(you must watch Stranger Things\). Composers often use a couple of chords from the minor family, in a process known as "modal interchange". Whenever we use one of these chords, you can feel immediately hear the change, the progression becomes magical, mysterious, darker. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
