/Title (We can expand our Matrix even more by adding the dominants of the dominants. These are like secondary degree cousins. Things can get a little complicated here. We will also add to the mix a set of minor chords that can also lead to the secondary dominants creating ii-V-I progressions. When the target chord in the nuclear family is minor, we can also include half dinished chords!)
